791 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H4/P 175 0 R/T(At the time, the main focus was on ergonomics, but that led to a huge oversight: we didn't add enough thickness \(1 mm\) to the cover after adding fillets and some surface curves, which caused the 3D print to feel like single-line threads on some portions and even break when a force was applied to it. Similarly, the casing didn't have enough tolerance for the cover. )/E(At the time, the main focus was on ergonomics, but that led to a huge oversight: we didn't add enough thickness \(1 mm\) to the cover after adding fillets and some surface curves, which caused the 3D print to feel like single-line threads on some portions and even break when a force was applied to it. Similarly, the casing didn't have enough tolerance for the cover. )/Pg 24 0 R/K[10]>>
endobj

